      "topic": "Contracts",
      "word": "abide by",
      "partOfSpeech": "v",
      "ipa": "əˈbaɪd baɪ",
      "vietnamese": "Tôn trọng, tuân theo, giữ (lời)",
      "definition": "to accept and act according to a law, an agreement",
      "hint": "a____ b_",
      "example": "The two parties agreed to abide by the judge's decision.",
